[{"title":"田家谣","author":"刘崧","text":"伐木修城更运粮，科铜采箭又徵鎗。\n耕牛掠尽丁男死，不信官田不解荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25159,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游里良感赋","author":"刘崧","text":"寺后青峰梵阁阴，寺前流水稻苗深。\n重寻稚子牵衣处，栗叶青青雨满林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25160,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题泰源堂壁上墨龙萧炼师画","author":"刘崧","text":"白鹤仙人剑气雄，蜿蜒鳞甲动秋风。\n何年飞上精蓝壁，海藏神珠彻夜红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25161,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题牧牛图","author":"刘崧","text":"牧子食牛牛性驯，一鞭斜日过平津。\n如何跃马金鞍客，不及逍遥垄上人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25162,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯莲水禽图","author":"刘崧","text":"绿房秋老骊珠黑，青箬霜馀翠羽乾。\n歌罢采莲人不见，雪姑飞去水云寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25163,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题子昂赵公竹石图","author":"刘崧","text":"丛竹娟娟露叶翻，高情长是忆王孙。\n喜从石上看书法，不独墙阴见雨痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25164,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋江晚渡小景","author":"刘崧","text":"满山黄叶乱秋晴，风款横江一棹轻。\n老屋溪南归未得，十年风