"}},{"title":"墨潺山中闻雁","author":"刘崧","text":"千山万山云雾堆，一声何处雁飞来。\n盘回欲下还惊起，月照寒潭一线开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"药湖书所见","author":"刘崧","text":"石根寒沼时时落，岭上荒田寸寸锄。\n已围荞麦防饥鹿，更插杉条护冻鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25216,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"药湖书所见","author":"刘崧","text":"败叶草荒馀箭眼，残兵衣秃见刀瘢。\n萧条香火枫林静，散漫人烟草阁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25217,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题古城耕钓图为王子让赋","author":"刘崧","text":"两角黄牛一钓竿，古城幽处足盘桓。\n乱来税水仍输秸，留取溪山画里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25218,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松竹居士集","author":"刘崧","text":"靖州令弟蚤称贤，小隐哦诗数百篇。\n松竹已荒文采在，清名留与后人传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25219,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余留宣溪旷氏几半月于别也承惟宁惟南伯仲率诸客送余江浒停舟赋诗眷眷有留恋之意明日到流江书此寄谢","author":"刘崧","text":"十人送行一人去，船头举手沙头语。\n船开山转水急流，白云杳杳知何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25220,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余留宣溪旷氏几半月于别也承惟宁惟南伯仲率诸客送余江浒停舟赋诗眷眷有留恋之意明日到流江书此寄谢","author":"刘崧","text":"停舟不发更歌诗，歌未成章意已悲。\n注目沧波相别处，断肠荒陇独归时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25221,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨坐候故人不至","author":"刘崧","text":"冬青叶上雨潇潇，虚馆山寒坐寂寥。\n还说南村收穫去，可能留客待明朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25222,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯花","author":"刘崧","text":"闭门坐待月光斜，应念行人未到家。\n好是客窗残酒醒，一帘风露看灯花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25223,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游洞玄坛","author":"刘崧","text":"河水西边万木群，三间茆屋祀真君。\n仙家阒静无尘榻，自扫青苔坐白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25224,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨竹赠同升","author":"刘崧","text":"郎石溪头君故家，前朝文物自清华。\n几回想踏桥边石，翠竹潇潇覆白沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25225,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题明皇优戏图","author":"刘崧","text":"臂袒红衫侧皂冠，翩跹跌舞乐初攒。\n笛声一片宫前起，应说秋风蜀道难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25226,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄示杨生元哲","author":"刘崧","text":"昨见王郎问吾子，山居鍊得好诗材。\n青年未必仍多病，却怕风寒不出来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25227,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄示杨生元哲","author":"刘崧","text":"我到流江一月馀，相思长把案头书。\n门前几树垂杨柳，比似别时今更疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25228,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见池上梨花","author":"刘崧","text":"梨花一树照清池，煖雪晴风二月时。\n忽忆小园曾种得，今年应发两三枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25229,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日见豫樟落叶有感","author":"刘崧","text":"豫樟凝绿雪霜中，何事春来一转蓬。\n自是新条更旧叶，不关摇落是东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25230,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宣和墨禽","author":"刘崧","text":"君王无那汴宫春，八宝笺明墨羽新。\n寂寞金舆滦水外，绣禽杨柳入边尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25231,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙盛开","author":"刘崧","text":"金沙花发绕亭东，万朵笼松满障红。\n安得移樽唤歌舞，为君醉倒锦屏中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25232,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜论诗和王子让三首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"明年期看上林花，烽火中原起叹嗟。\n旧业可堪沦草莽，高怀元不累尘沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25233,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜论诗和王子让三首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"江草青青江水生，故人相见总怜情。\n云来雨去青天里，一日阴晴几变更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25234,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜论诗和王子让三首 其三","author":"刘崧","text":"古今作者自联绵，白首穷愁也可怜。\n须信乾坤同照耀，肯教光景付流连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25235,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雨","author":"刘崧","text":"一夜山中听雨眠，重檐深院烛花偏。\n珠湖滩下水三尺，不知流却木兰船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄罗惠卿","author":"刘崧","text":"园西翠韭千畦密，屋后红椒万本疏。\n日晏荷锄归未得，林风吹乱读残书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25237,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]